# Rust build artefacts
/target
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb

# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed: `ion` ships a binary, and a reproducible
# dependency graph is part of the deliverable.

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Local task frames and captured result frames
*.bin
*.out

# Anything that could carry a real credential must never be committed.
# TSIG secrets belong in VX_TSIG_SECRET, not in a file.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.tsig
tsig-*.conf
